<section style="background:#0a0a0a;min-height:60vh;padding:4rem 0;">
  <div class="page-content">

    <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:16px;margin-bottom:1.5rem;">
      <div style="height:1px;width:32px;background:#C9A84C;"></div>
      <span style="font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-size:0.65rem;font-weight:900;letter-spacing:0.25em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9A84C;">Legal</span>
    </div>

    <h1>Cookie Policy</h1>

    <p>Last updated: January 2025</p>

    <h2>What Are Cookies?</h2>
    <p>Cookies are small text files stored on your device when you visit a website. They help websites remember your preferences and improve your experience.</p>

    <h2>Cookies We Use</h2>

    <h3>Essential Cookies (always active)</h3>
    <p>These cookies are required for the store to function and cannot be switched off.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>cart</strong> — Keeps your shopping cart contents between pages</li>
      <li><strong>_shopify_session</strong> — Maintains your session while browsing</li>
      <li><strong>_shopify_y</strong> — Tracks your visit for fraud prevention</li>
      <li><strong>secure_customer_sig</strong> — Authenticates your account (if logged in)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Preference Cookies</h3>
    <p>These remember choices you've made on our site.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>cookie_consent_00s</strong> — Stores your cookie consent decision</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Analytics Cookies (only with consent)</h3>
    <p>These help us understand how visitors use our store so we can improve it.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>_ga</strong> — Google Analytics (visitor statistics, 2-year expiry)</li>
      <li><strong>_gid</strong> — Google Analytics (session data, 24-hour expiry)</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Marketing Cookies (only with consent)</h3>
    <p>Used to show relevant ads across other websites.</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>_fbp</strong> — Facebook Pixel (ad targeting)</li>
      <li><strong>_tt_</strong> — TikTok Pixel (ad targeting)</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Managing Cookies</h2>
    <p>You can control cookies through our cookie banner when you first visit. You can also manage them in your browser settings. Note that disabling essential cookies will break core store functionality (cart, checkout).</p>
    <p>To opt out of analytics tracking, visit <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Google's opt-out page</a>.</p>

    <h2>Third-Party Cookies</h2>
    <p>Our store is powered by Shopify. Shopify may set additional cookies for security and analytics purposes. See <a href="https://www.shopify.com/legal/cookies" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Shopify's cookie policy</a> for details.</p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions about our use of cookies? Email <a href="mailto:privacy@the00sversion.com">privacy@the00sversion.com</a>.</p>

  </div>
</section>

